---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import SiteNav from "../components/SiteNav.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";

const title = "About Arkansas Automated | Andre Brassfield, Fort Smith";
const description = "Arkansas Automated tests and fixes how Arkansas home service businesses answer, follow up and get reviewed. Run by Andre Brassfield in Fort Smith. Not affiliated with Arkansas Automated Security.";
---

<Base title={title} description={description} path="/about">
  <SiteNav />
  <main id="main-content" tabindex="-1">
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container article-body">
        <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>About</span></nav>
        <h1 class="heading-lg">One person you can call, in Fort Smith.</h1>
        <p class="body-lg">Arkansas Automated tests and fixes how Arkansas home service businesses answer, follow up and get reviewed. It is run by Andre Brassfield in Fort Smith and works in person across the River Valley and Northwest Arkansas.</p>
        <p>Every engagement starts with the free <a class="text-link" href="/phone-test">Phone Test</a>: we call your shop during the day and after hours, fill out your form, text your number and check your Google listing, then show you the score. Fixes are priced on the <a class="text-link" href="/services">services page</a>.</p>
        <h2 class="heading-md" id="andre-brassfield">The record behind the name</h2>
        <p>Before Arkansas Automated, Andre Brassfield spent a decade running sales organizations. He was National Director of Sales at Improvifi, running the national sales operation for a home improvement financing platform and the contractor network on it. Before that he founded a regional construction and roofing company and built it from zero: crews, vendors, jobs, and the systems that held them together.</p>
        <p>That is why the Phone Test exists. A contractor who misses the call loses the job, and nobody tells him. He runs every test himself.</p>
        <h2 class="heading-md">What we do not sell</h2>
        <p>AI receptionists, answering services, booking software and custom software builds. We set things up so your own phones ring the right people first, and every missed call or form gets a fast text and a follow-up a person sees.</p>
        <h2 class="heading-md">Where automation stops</h2>
        <p>Judgment, negotiation, pricing exceptions, and trust-building conversations stay with people. Read our <a class="text-link" href="/automation-guardrails">automation guardrails</a> for the operating principles we use.</p>
        <h2 class="heading-md">About the name</h2>
        <p>Arkansas Automated is operated by Andre Brassfield, based in Fort Smith, Arkansas. We are not affiliated with Arkansas Automated Security, LLC of Mayflower, Arkansas, which is a separate security and alarm installation business.</p>
        <div class="next-step"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/phone-test" data-cta="about-phone-test">Get my free Phone Test</a></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</Base>
